r($conn,$L21,'Bao ve ngoi nha chung','我们的地球正面临着严重的环境问题。随着工业的发展，空气污染和水污染越来越严重。很多人还没有意识到，保护环境其实就是在保护我们自己。对于每个人来说，减少浪费、节约能源都是很容易做到的事情。出门时关灯、节约用水、少用塑料袋，这些小事看起来不起眼，但如果每个人都这样做，效果就会非常大。在环保方面，我们还可以选择绿色出行，比如骑自行车或坐公交车。否则，等到环境被破坏了再后悔就来不及了。让我们从今天开始，一起保护我们的家园吧。','Wo men de di qiu zheng mian lin zhe yan zhong de huan jing wen ti. Sui zhe gong ye de fa zhan, kong qi wu ran he shui wu ran yue lai yue yan zhong. Hen duo ren hai mei you yi shi dao, bao hu huan jing qi shi jiu shi zai bao hu wo men zi ji. Dui yu mei ge ren lai shuo, jian shao lang fei、jie yue neng yuan dou shi hen rong yi zuo dao de shi qing. Chu men shi guan deng、jie yue yong shui、shao yong su liao dai, zhe xie xiao shi kan qi lai bu qi yan, dan ru guo mei ge ren dou zhe yang zuo, xiao guo jiu hui fei chang da. Zai huan bao fang mian, wo men hai ke yi xuan ze lv se chu xing, bi ru qi zi xing che huo zuo gong jiao che. Fou ze, deng dao huan jing bei po huai le zai hou hui jiu lai bu ji le. Rang wo men cong jin tian kai shi, yi qi bao hu wo men de jia yuan ba.','Trai dat dang doi mat o nhiem nghiem trong. Cung voi cong nghiep phat trien, o nhiem khong khi va nuoc nang hon. Nhieu nguoi chua nhan ra BVMT la bao ve chinh minh. Giam lang phi, tiet kiem nang luong la viec de lam. Den tat den, tiet kiem nuoc, it dung tui nilon - viec nho co tac dung lon. Chon di lai xanh nhu xe dap. Neu ko, khi MT huy hoai roi thi qua muon. Cung BVMT tu hom nay.','medium',180,1);
$L21l=l($conn,$L21,'BV moi truong','A: Ban co thoi quen BVMT ko? B: Co, toi phan loai rac va tiet kiem nuoc. A: Tai sao ban lam vay? B: Vi toi nghi moi nguoi nen co trach nhiem voi moi truong. A: Ban co di xe dap ko? B: Cuoi tuan co, vua BVMT vua tap the duc.','A: Ni you bao hu huan jing de xi guan ma? B: You, wo la ji fen lei he jie yue yong shui. A: Wei shen me ni zhe yang zuo? B: Yin wei wo jue de mei ge ren dou ying gai dui huan jing fu ze. A: Ni hui qi zi xing che ma? B: Zhou mo hui, ji huan bao you yun dong.','A: Ban co thoi quen BVMT ko? B: Co, toi phan loai rac va tiet kiem nuoc. A: Tai sao ban lam vay? B: Vi toi nghi moi nguoi nen co trach nhiem voi moi truong. A: Ban co di xe dap ko? B: Cuoi tuan co, vua BVMT vua tap the duc.','1');
lq($conn,$L21l,'B co thoi quen BVMT nao?','{"A":"Di xe may","B":"Phan loai rac","C":"Dung nhieu tui nilon"}','Phan loai rac','Phan loai rac va tiet kiem nuoc.','multiple_choice',1);
