r($conn,$L22,'Tinh ban giua ban be','友谊是人生中最宝贵的财富之一。朋友之间的信任和理解，是友谊长久的基础。真正的朋友不会因为距离而变得陌生，也不会因为时间而忘记对方。我和小华认识已经十年了，我们之间从来没有过真正的争吵。即使有不同的意见，我们也会互相尊重和理解。有时候我们会很久不联系，但当我们再次见面的时候，仍然像以前一样亲密。难道这不是真正的友谊吗？我始终相信，真诚是友谊最重要的东西。如果不珍惜，再好的友谊也会失去。既然我们拥有这份友谊，就应该用心去维护它。','You yi shi ren sheng zhong zui bao gui de cai fu zhi yi. Peng you zhi jian de xin ren he li jie, shi you yi chang jiu de ji chu. Zhen zheng de peng you bu hui yin wei ju li er bian de mo sheng, ye bu hui yin wei shi jian er wang ji dui fang. Wo he Xiao Hua ren shi yi jing shi nian le, wo men zhi jian cong lai mei you guo zhen zheng de zheng chao. Ji shi you bu tong de yi jian, wo men ye hui hu xiang zun zhong he li jie. You shi hou wo men hui hen jiu bu lian xi, dan dang wo men zai ci jian mian de shi hou, reng ran xiang yi qian yi yang qin mi. Nan dao zhe bu shi zhen zheng de you yi ma? Wo shi zhong xiang xin, zhen cheng shi you yi zui zhong yao de dong xi. Ru guo bu zhen xi, zai hao de you yi ye hui shi qu. Ji ran wo men yong you zhe fen you yi, jiu ying gai yong xin qu wei hu ta.','Tinh ban la tai san quy nhat doi. Tin tuong va thau hieu la nen tang. Ban that su ko vi xa cach ma la, ko vi thoi gian ma quen. Toi va Tieu Hoa quen 10 nam, chua tung cai nhau. Co y kien khac cung ton trong. Lau ko gap nhung gap lai van than. Le nao do ko phai tinh ban that su? Toi tin chan thanh la quan trong nhat. Ko tran trong se mat. Da co tinh ban, hay gin giu.','medium',195,1);
$L22l=l($conn,$L22,'Tinh ban','A: Ban co nghe noi Minh va Tuan gianh nhau ko? B: Co. Ho cai nhau vi chuyen nho. A: Le nao 10 nam tinh ban vi chuyen nho ma ket thuc? B: Ko dau. Ho da tha thu cho nhau roi. A: Toi mung. Tinh ban that su ko vi ly do nho ma tan vo. B: Dung. Chan thanh va thau hieu la quan trong nhat.','A: Ni ting shuo Ming he Tuan chao jia le ma? B: Ting shuo le. Shi yin wei yi jian xiao shi. A: Nan dao shi nian de you yi jiu yin wei zhe ge jie shu le ma? B: Bu shi, ta men yi jing yuan liang bi ci le. A: Na jiu hao. Zhen zheng de you yi bing bu hui yin wei xiao shi jiu jie shu. B: Dui, zhen cheng he li jie cai shi zui bang de.','A: Ban co nghe noi Minh va Tuan gianh nhau ko? B: Co. Ho cai nhau vi chuyen nho. A: Le nao 10 nam tinh ban vi chuyen nho ma ket thuc? B: Ko dau. Ho da tha thu cho nhau roi. A: Toi mung. Tinh ban that su ko vi ly do nho ma tan vo. B: Dung. Chan thanh va thau hieu la quan trong nhat.','1');
